520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Board, composed of no more than five \(5\) members appointed by the Cabinet of Saint Lucia, plays a crucial role in overseeing the Citizenship by Investment Programme. )
/E (The Board, composed of no more than five \(5\) members appointed by the Cabinet of Saint Lucia, plays a crucial role in overseeing the Citizenship by Investment Programme. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Board consists of a Chairperson - Mr. Lorne Theophilus, Deputy-Chairperson, Mr. Julian Charles, Directors Mr. Sean Alexander, Mr. Rene Williams and Mr. Efrem Edgar who were all appointed to the Board on 1 September, 2021. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 384 0 R
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Sadly, Mr. Edgar who fell ill passed away on 24 May, 2022 resulting in the vacancy of one Director position on 24 May, 2022. He was later replaced by Ms. Isa Cyril, an Attorney-at-Law and Crown Counsel IV from the Office of the Director of Public Prosecutions who was appointed as Director on 1 December, 2022. Ms. Cyril served on the Board for a period of three\( 3\) months before departing on 8 March 2023.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
524 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Board is responsible for efficiently coordinating, administering, and overseeing the operations of the Citizenship by Investment Unit. This includes reviewing and making decisions on applications for citizenship by investment in Saint Lucia, establishing the functions and duties of the Citizenship by Investment Unit, and issuing guidelines to ensure the proper functioning of the Saint Lucia Citizenship by Investment Programme.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
525 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
