<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A respected figure in his community of Choiseul and Saint Lucia at large, Mr. Edgar also served as a dedicated Director of the Citizenship by Investment Programme \(CIP\) in Saint Lucia.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
