<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The just concluded period has seen the doubling of marketing agents, with the addition of experienced and respected brands from the industry; increased visibility from emerging territories in the Middle East and Northern Africa and consistent efforts made to improve our already robust due diligence processes.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
566 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To further strengthen our operations, we have increased our human capital to ensure a more streamlined application and effective due diligence process. We have also collaborated with industry-leading firms to align our training and development with the evolving geo-political landscape and human trends, both positive and negative.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
