>>
endobj
568 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (These changes have been implemented with a clear focus on maintaining the integrity of Saint Lucia's strong brand. In our industry, precision is paramount, and we are guided by our "Beyond the Passport" mantra.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We view our Saint Lucian citizenship as more than just a means for visa-free travel. Infact, we reject such narrow thinking! For us, Saint Lucia represents a hub of investment opportunities, lifestyle experiences, romantic encounters, and an overall positive atmosphere. Becoming a Saint Lucian entails a commitment to enhancing these value propositions and contributing to the growth of our brand, Saint Lucia.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
570 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I must acknowledge the dedicated team at the Citizenship by Investment Unit, who are the driving force behind our operations. In an industry that demands more than a standard eight-hour workday, these professionals exemplify patriotism and go above and beyond to ensure the success of the Citizenship by Investment Programme and, by extension, Saint Lucia.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
571 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the coming year we will build on the successes of 2022/2023 as we look forward to a further expansion in our reach and interest. These developments, we expect will solidify our position as a leader in the investment migration sector and serve to improve the quality of life for our citizens.  )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
