619 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The Citizenship by Investment Programme has evolved to focus on providing citizens with opportunities that go beyond simply obtaining a passport. This shift is exemplified by the launch of the campaign "Beyond the Passport." We warmly welcome our global citizens to explore the myriad possibilities for vacationing, investing, building, and establishing themselves in Saint Lucia.)
/E (The Citizenship by Investment Programme has evolved to focus on providing citizens with opportunities that go beyond simply obtaining a passport. This shift is exemplified by the launch of the campaign "Beyond the Passport." We warmly welcome our global citizens to explore the myriad possibilities for vacationing, investing, building, and establishing themselves in Saint Lucia.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (In recent years, there has been a growing concern among citizens about how funds generated from citizenship by investment programs are utilized. Various recommendations have been proposed to ensure a more transparent process in identifying the tangible benefits of offering citizenship in exchange for an approved investment.)
/E (In recent years, there has been a growing concern among citizens about how funds generated from citizenship by investment programs are utilized. Various recommendations have been proposed to ensure a more transparent process in identifying the tangible benefits of offering citizenship in exchange for an approved investment.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The COVID-19 pandemic has had a devastating impact on the tourism industry, leading to closed airports and travel restrictions. This has highlighted the importance of citizenship programs in attracting foreign direct investment. It is now more crucial than ever for us, as global citizens, to acknowledge our role in sustaining our world through our actions.)
/E (The COVID-19 pandemic has had a devastating impact on the tourism industry, leading to closed airports and travel restrictions. This has highlighted the importance of citizenship programs in attracting foreign direct investment. It is now more crucial than ever for us, as global citizens, to acknowledge our role in sustaining our world through our actions.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (CIP Saint Lucia, in collaboration with the Government and people of Saint Lucia, extended a heartfelt invitation to all global citizens who have acquired citizenship through the investment programme. We encourage all citizens to Visit/Vacation, Invest, Build, and Establish themselves on our beautiful island through the VIBE initiative.)
/E (CIP Saint Lucia, in collaboration with the Government and people of Saint Lucia, extended a heartfelt invitation to all global citizens who have acquired citizenship through the investment programme. We encourage all citizens to Visit/Vacation, Invest, Build, and Establish themselves on our beautiful island through the VIBE initiative.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (It is our belief that Saint Lucia offers much more as a destination than just the convenience of visa-free travel. The establishment of opportunities for all citizens, beyond the advantages of holding a passport, underscores the value of citizenship through investment programs and their tangible impact on the populace.)
/E (It is our belief that Saint Lucia offers much more as a destination than just the convenience of visa-free travel. The establishment of opportunities for all citizens, beyond the advantages of holding a passport, underscores the value of citizenship through investment programs and their tangible impact on the populace.)
