endobj
625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Saint Lucia is renowned for its stunning natural beauty and the hospitality of its people. The island boasts international and domestic airports that welcome daily flights from the USA, Canada, Europe, and the wider region. Saint Lucia invites its citizens to embark on a journey of discovery that will leave a lasting impression. Come to Saint Lucia and let the island inspire you!)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
