endobj
627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Saint Lucia is renowned for its diverse investment opportunities, spanning from tourism and agro-processing to renewable energy, global business outsourcing, and smart manufacturing. Saint Lucia welcomes investors with open arms. Seize the opportunity to make your mark in this thriving economy!)
