629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Situated below the hurricane belt, Saint Lucia is a sought-after retirement destination renowned for its understated elegance and lively atmosphere. The island's blend of English and French influences gives it a distinct creole charm, complemented by efficient shipping and air freight services, a robust telecommunications industry, a thriving financial sector, and top-tier education and healthcare facilities. Saint Lucia eagerly awaits your arrival to make it your new home.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
