endobj
640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Citizenship by Investment Programme hosted a group of individuals who were granted citizenship through the programme. These citizens had the privilege of visiting the island during the vibrant carnival season in July 2022. This unique experience, known as the Citizen Xperience, was designed to immerse the visitors in the rich culture of Saint Lucia.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
641 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The primary objective of the Citizen Xperience was to provide a lasting impact on the visiting citizens, and this goal was undeniably achieved. Throughout their visit, the citizens had the opportunity to witness traditional dances, partake in joyful celebrations, and truly experience the essence of island life. Some even chose to renew their marriage vows, while children delighted in the simple pleasures that Saint Lucia has to offer.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
642 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition to cultural immersion, the visiting citizens were also able to explore potential investment opportunities on the island. This included the option to establish vacation and retirement homes, showcasing the potential for long-term growth and prosperity.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
643 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Overall, the Citizen Xperience proved to be a memorable and enriching opportunity for all involved. Not only did it highlight the beauty of Saint Lucian culture, but it also emphasized the island's potential for investment and development.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Citizenship Programme had the honor of hosting Mohamed \(@rahalista\) in January 2023 on the picturesque island of Saint Lucia. Mohamed is a well-known influencer and content creator who shares captivating stories from around the world.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
645 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With an impressive 3.5 million followers across Facebook, Instagram, and YouTube, Rahalista's audience comes from various Arab countries, particularly Saudi Arabia and Libya which are important markets for investment migration. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
646 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
647 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (His main objective is to inspire individuals to pursue their passions, no matter how unconventional they may seem. What better place to continue his journey than his homeland.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Rahalista beautifully captured the essence of authentic Saint Lucia, garnering over 1 million views on YouTube and more than 50,000 impressions on Instagram. His itinerary included visits to the Castries Market, Howelton Estate, Morne Fortune Tour, Gros Islet Friday Night Street Party, The Cocoa Tour at Hotel Chocolat, and Tet Paul Nature Trail, among others.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [31]
>>
endobj
649 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Among his most cherished moments were leisurely walks and playing dominoes with the elders in Gros Islet. He also found peace in visiting the Castries Mosque during prayer hours. Born in Libya, Mohamed now holds Saint Lucian values close to his heart.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
