673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This fiscal year 2022/2023 has marked a significant milestone in the advancement of our technological infrastructure, showcasing our unwavering dedication to excellence and innovation.)
/E (This fiscal year 2022/2023 has marked a significant milestone in the advancement of our technological infrastructure, showcasing our unwavering dedication to excellence and innovation.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
674 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One of the most notable achievements during this period has been the extensive enhancement of our internal network infrastructure. For the first time in the history of our Unit, we have made substantial investments in upgrading our network components, resulting in a more contemporary and resilient technology framework that is poised to meet the demands of our operations for the next 7-10 years. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This upgraded infrastructure not only offers a plethora of modern features but also delivers exceptional speed, efficiency, and security, perfectly aligning with the ever-evolving IT landscape of today.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
676 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition to infrastructure improvements, the IT Department has experienced significant growth in its user base. We have expanded our IT support from serving seventeen \(17\) users to efficiently meeting the needs of twenty-six \(26\) users. This expansion involved the provisioning of new laptops, monitors, printers, and other peripherals to our staff, along with their configuration and maintenance.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
677 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This expansion underscores our commitment to providing seamless IT support to meet the evolving demands of our organization as technology becomes increasingly integral across various departments.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Looking ahead, our focus is on the development and planning of an upgraded Citizenship by Investment Portal Version 2 and the Alien Landholding Portal. These initiatives are built on a new programming architecture to enhance efficiency, increase capacity, improve speed, introduce new features, and bolster security for our Citizenship Unit's operations. This modernized foundation will enable the seamless integration of advanced features, ensuring adaptability to future requirements.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
679 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition to software enhancements, we have procured critical IT infrastructure equipment. These acquisitions are essential in strengthening our overall IT framework, ensuring reliability, and mitigating potential disruptions.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
680 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Looking forward, the future of the IT Department involves completing these upgrades and maintaining a focus on leveraging technology to enhance and streamline our citizenship application processes. By embracing these advancements, we will position ourselves at the forefront of technological innovation, promoting efficiency, and upholding the high standards that define Saint Lucia Citizenship by Investment Programme.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
