693 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Investment Migration or Citizenship-by-Investment Industry operates under the fundamental principles of transparency, efficiency, and due diligence. The Saint Lucia Citizenship by Investment Unit employs a comprehensive and rigorous approach to due diligence.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
694 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Before accepting a citizenship application, our partner agents meticulously screen applicants using KYC \(know your client\) protocols and other online database systems to ensure they meet the requirements of the Saint Lucia Citizenship Programme.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
695 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Furthermore, throughout the verification and vetting process of citizenship applications, the Citizenship by Investment Unit collaborates closely with local law enforcement, regional intelligence partners, and reputable international firms. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
