918 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Additionally, COE and ALHL holders can apply for an alien investor entrance permit, allowing them to stay in St. Lucia while holding a licence. This process involves requesting a support letter from the Unit and submitting it with the application to the Immigration Department. The dependants of beneficial owners and directors or partners of alien entities are also eligible to apply for alien investor entrance permits.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [9]
>>
