/T (CHALLENGES)
/E (CHALLENGES)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
920 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In early 2022, the Department faced inter-agency challenges that significantly affected our operations and efficiency. A major issue encountered was the delayed response times from other key government agencies to requests that are mandatory under the Act. This delay impeded the ability to process applications promptly and accurately within given estimated application timelines. As there was some initial confusion regarding the specific requirements from the various government agencies.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
921 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (PROACTIVE MEASURES AND SUCCESSES)
/E (PROACTIVE MEASURES AND SUCCESSES)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
922 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Despite facing various challenges, our department achieved significant successes in the 2022/2023 fiscal year through effective communication and strategic planning. We successfully clarified roles and responsibilities, ensuring that all involved agencies understood their scope under the Act. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
