927 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By gaining a thorough understanding of the constraints and processes of the government agency, we were able to establish realistic timelines and implement direct communication channels, ultimately enhancing efficiency and responsiveness. This approach not only streamlined operations and improved transparency but also increased stakeholder satisfaction, showcasing our dedication to overcoming inter-agency challenges and enhancing overall efficiency.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
>>
