929 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During the reporting period of 2022/2023, a total of 169 applications were received. Specifically, there were 77 applications for Certificates of Eligibility \(COE\) and 92 applications for Alien Landholding Licenses \(ALHL\). Out of these, 75 COE applications were approved, while 2 were denied. Additionally, 52 ALHL applications were granted, with 40 being denied. I)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
